      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "La petite ville de Colon, dans le Michigan, est la capitale mondiale de la magie autoproclamée. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "746987_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Ce n’est pas le fait le plus important, mais j’avais vraiment besoin d’une excuse pour dire Pee Pee Township. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "746988_2",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Since it’s commonly known as the “magic capital of the world” where did this never ending magic scarf most likely originate?",
      "t": "A",
